# =====================================================
# Vendored catalog data (16 MB) — re-create with `pnpm vendor-catalog`
# =====================================================
# The ResearchGalaxy cluster JSONs are large data files. They are vendored
# locally for development and `pnpm vendor-catalog` re-creates them from
# $RESEARCHGALAXY_PATH (defaults to ~/Desktop/ProjectResearchGala).
# For production deploy on Render: either commit the catalog from a clean
# working tree before push, host it on S3/Git LFS, or run vendor-catalog
# with a remote source as a build step.
/public/catalog/cluster_details/
/public/catalog/all_venues_cluster_themes.json

# =====================================================
# Notes
# =====================================================
# `plans/` is intentionally tracked — it contains the architecture
# source-of-truth doc. If a particular plan file is session-specific,
# ignore it by exact name rather than the whole directory.
